        "title": "Second Derivative Test",
        "text": "The second derivative test:\n\n- If $f''(x) < 0$, the point is a LOCAL MAXIMUM\n- If $f''(x) > 0$, the point is a LOCAL MINIMUM\n- If $f''(x) = 0$, the test is inconclusive",
